{'symbol': 'CNP', 'date': '2021-05-10 08:30:00', 'title': 'CENTERPOINT ENERGY CHOOSES EFI TO EXPAND CUSTOMER SAVINGS AND ENGAGEMENT WITH UTILITY MARKETPLACE AND INSTANT REBATE PROGRAMS IN INDIANA', 'text': 'BOSTON, MAY 10, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CENTERPOINT ENERGY IS PARTNERING WITH UTILITY MARKETPLACE LEADER, ENERGY FEDERATION, INC, (EFI) TO LAUNCH A NEW ENERGY EFFICIENT PRODUCT, EDUCATIONAL MARKETPLACE, AND INSTANT REBATE PROGRAM IN INDIANA. THE PROGRAM WILL PROVIDE NEW AND INNOVATIVE WAYS TO REACH UTILITY CUSTOMERS WHILE INCREASING SAVINGS AND IMPROVING OVERALL ENGAGEMENT.'}